 or creeps. Feral converts into HP after leaving combat.\nPower of Wildness: After Masha's skills deal damage to an enemy hero, she leaves a Wound in a random direction. Her Basic Attacks can break the Wound and cause her to enter the Feral state.\nFeral: Masha gains 15 (+1*Hero Level)% Resilience, Attack Speed, and Movement Speed. Her next 3 Basic Attacks become fan-shaped claw strikes, dealing 3 (+2% Extra Physical Attack) (+0.2*Hero Level)%  extra Physical Damage to enemies in the area (extra damage does not apply to Turrets) and recovering 4 (+0.4*Hero Level)% HP. It lasts 3s.\n[C8Breaking a Wound again during the Feral state will refresh its duration. Up to 6 claw strikes can be stored.]","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_6542c500aa72062c01ec90a3228e83bf.png","video":null,"cd":null,"cost":null,"is_passive":true,"tags":[{"name":"Buff","rgb":"79,156,184"}]},{"id":8810,"name":"Feral Swipe","description":"Masha releases energy forward, dealing 250 (+70% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in its path.\nIf an enemy hero is hit, they are slowed by 50% for 1s.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_0d1830ffdf3eda7e34a33f879aea70d1.png","video":null,"cd":8.0,"cost":null,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"AOE","rgb":"199,121,85"},{"name":"Slow","rgb":"205,93,109"}]},{"id":8820,"name":"Claw Strike","description":"Masha dashes in the target direction, dealing 120 (+80% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage.\n[C8Whenever an HP bar is depleted, the cooldown of Claw Strike resets.]","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b137533c0a7e40fb4759d2b68ffbc230.png","video":null,"cd":9.0,"cost":null,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Mobility","rgb":"162,105,198"},{"name":"Damage","rgb":"199,121,85"}]},{"id":8830,"name":"Savage Maul","description":"Masha charges toward an enemy hero, dealing 300 (+50% Extra Max HP) Physical Damage and stunning them for 1s while knocking back nearby enemies.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_a973d17d6ff36a513b419a343a131997.png","video":null,"cd":42.0,"cost":null,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"CC","rgb":"205,93,109"}]}],"counters":{"assist":{"desc":"Masha also pairs well with CC heroes like Atlas and Minotaur. Once they pull the enemies together, she can tear them to shreds with her savage claws!","heroes":[{"id":93,"name":"Atlas","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_d974ac796678180ff8724b88e192898b.png"},{"id":19,"name":"Minotaur","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_3ecd2c0843df7ec85044dafff6bf4553.png"}]},"strong":{"desc":"Burst Mages like Eudora and Kadita are ideal prey for Masha. With three HP bars and CC removal plus damage negation when losing a bar, Masha has built-in anti-burst against them.","heroes":[{"id":15,"name":"Eudora","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_87b2a655b254c136dce8976e21935a80.png"},{"id":75,"name":"Kadita","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_99c0a77d0e01b06ad3f4351f8ef2869c.png"}]},"weak":{"desc":"Choose highly mobile heroes with multiple dashes, such as Fanny or Claude. Thwart her initiation, then focus her down before she goes Feral.","heroes":[{"id":17,"name":"Fanny","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_3391df36d6dcc54dd1c417098e15ec59.png"},{"id":65,"name":"Claude","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_e1097b9d3e1d5e9f14600d32e8b18acd.png"}]}},"official_url":"https://play.mobilelegends.com/lore/hero/Masha","skins":[{"name":"Combat Maiden","name_slug":"Combat-Maiden","image":"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/masha/Masha-Combat-Maiden-20200627082821.web